# Asters Guild (Eris DEPARTMENT_GUILD / trade / mining)

## Entities
ent-OxydTradeConsole = trade console
    .desc = The Asters Guild Trading Program terminal — links to the trade station network.
ent-OxydTradeRequestConsole = trade request console
    .desc = Crew-facing trade requests console of the Asters Guild.
ent-OxydTradeBeaconReceiving = receiving trade beacon
    .desc = Marks where ordered trade goods materialize.
ent-OxydTradeBeaconSending = sending trade beacon
    .desc = Marks where goods staged for export are shipped from.
ent-OxydOreProcessorConsole = processing unit console
    .desc = Controls the nearby ore processing unit: melting rate, material storage, alloys.
ent-OxydOreProcessor = ore processing unit
    .desc = Smelts ore chunks into sheets. Feed ore into it, control from the console.
ent-OxydDeepDrill = deep drill
    .desc = Bores deep into the asteroid, slowly drawing up ore.
ent-OxydCashRegister = cash register
    .desc = Rings up credit sales for the Asters Guild.
ent-OxydEftpos = EFTPOS terminal
    .desc = A portable credit payment terminal.
ent-OxydTradeCrate = trade crate
    .desc = A steel shipping crate — ordered goods arrive packed inside.
ent-OxydAtm = ATM
    .desc = An Asters Guild teller terminal linked to the shared guild account.
ent-OxydVendingPowermat = Powermat
    .desc = Power cells of every grade, wired straight from Guild stock.
ent-OxydVendingPrintomat = Print-o-mat
    .desc = Vends Guild design disks for the autolathe trade.
ent-OxydVendingStyle = Stylin' Bottlecaps
    .desc = Guild-issue fashion for the discerning spacer.

ent-OxydCredits1 = credit
    .desc = A single Guild credit.
ent-OxydCredits100 = credits
    .desc = A handful of Guild credits.
ent-OxydCredits500 = credits
    .desc = A wad of Guild credits.

## Stacks (oxyd-* loc allowed for stacks)
oxyd-stack-credits = credits

