oxyd-access-guild-merchant = Guild Merchant
oxyd-access-guild-tech = Guild Technician
oxyd-access-guild-miner = Guild Miner
oxyd-access-guild-cargo = Guild Cargo

## Department
department-AstersGuild = Asters Guild
department-AstersGuild-description = Trade, mining, and logistics run by the Asters Guild.

## Jobs
job-name-oxyd-guild-merchant = Guild Merchant
job-description-oxyd-guild-merchant = Head of the Asters Guild aboard the station. Run the trade console, set prices, and keep credits flowing.
job-name-oxyd-guild-tech = Guild Technician
job-description-oxyd-guild-tech = Work the beacons, crates, and deliveries of the Asters Guild trade network.
job-name-oxyd-guild-miner = Guild Miner
job-description-oxyd-guild-miner = Bore for ore, feed the processor, and keep the Guild's material pipeline running.
